# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — 头文件装入 include/<subdir> 导致 test_package 找不到（Makefile 变体）═══
# Timestamp: 2026-09-07
# Software: openlibm 0.8.8
# Gate: conan-verify G2 (test_package)
# Status: UNMATCHED (partial overlap with E217) — needs human/AI review to promote to E-entry
# Relation: similar_to=E217 (CMake variant); E217 covers CMake install(FILES DESTINATION include/<subdir>),
#           this draft covers Makefile-style install-headers into include/<subdir>.

id: DRAFT-openlibm-0.8.8
severity: 2
category: headers|conan|makefile
trigger_tool: conan|make
phase: testing
approach: 先读上游安装规则（CMake install() 或 Makefile install-headers/install 目标），确认头文件实际落在
  include/<subdir>，再把 conanfile.py package_info() 的 cpp_info.includedirs 指向该子目录（如
  ["include/openlibm"]），使 test_package 的直接 #include <xxx.h> 可解析；与上游自带 .pc 文件的
  Cflags(-I<includedir>/<subdir>) 保持一致是最稳的锚点。

keywords: includedirs, test_package, header not found, include subdir, Makefile install-headers,
  openlibm, fatal error, cpp_info

error_signature: fatal error: '[a-z_]+\.h' file not found|test_package.*\.c:\d+:\d+: fatal error|openlibm\.h.*file not found
match_keywords: file not found, includedirs, test_package, header, install-headers, include subdir

root_cause: 上游库（无论 CMake 还是 Makefile 驱动）把头文件安装到 include/<subdir>（如 openlibm 的
  install-headers 复制到 $(includedir)/openlibm），而 conan-init 模板 package_info() 默认
  includedirs=["include"]，消费者/test_package 直接 #include <xxx.h> 时头文件解析不到，
  conan-verify G2 在 test_package 编译阶段失败。
affected_scope: 所有把头文件安装到 include/<subdir> 的库（Makefile install-headers 或 CMake
  install DESTINATION include/<project> 驱动；CMake 变体见 E217）

rec_priority: 1
rec_command: 检查上游安装规则: grep -n "includedir" <src>/Makefile；grep -rn "DESTINATION include" <src>/CMakeLists.txt；
  修改 conanfile.py: self.cpp_info.includedirs = ["include/<subdir>"]

verification_cmd: python3 scripts/ohc-run.py conan-verify openlibm 0.8.8   # G2 test_package 阶段通过
evidence: openlibm 0.8.8 R01 —— 修复前 test_package 报 "fatal error: 'openlibm.h' file not found"（G2 FAIL）；
  修复 cpp_info.includedirs=["include/openlibm"] 后 conan-verify G1-G4 全过，test_package ctest 1/1 通过。
principles: R34 (test 必须实质依赖被测包), R28 (test_package 必填)